Viktor 07.10.2026: «В шпаргалке по стилям и инструментам проблемка. Не работает кликание, вставка, копирование». A click did put a name into the Style prompt, but its words showed under the sheet (toasts at 40, the sheet at 70) and the prompt is under the sheet too: the toasts stand over every window now (the pointer goes through them), a name the prompt holds is marked in the sheet, a click copies the name too (the page's own copy, which works over plain http; «· copied» only when it did), and the sheet's text selects again.

«Ширину зафиксируй в дропдауне подстановки по `[`»: 460 px whatever the note says, the note two lines high. «те суно теги `[Break]`, если уж нет их в оф. примерах… Они не работают»: [Break] and the studio's own [Inst] are gone from the sheet and the list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
